OL,3,GNEWSASlugs to blame for mystery of
OL,4,Afaulty traffic lights
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe mystery of why malfunctioning
OL,7,Ftraffic lights have been causing chaos
OL,8,Ffor motorists for weeks has been
OL,9,Frevealed - and it turns out slugs are
OL,10,Fto blame.
OL,12,FDespite being fixed or replaced, the
OL,13,Flights at the Robin Hood crossroads in
OL,14,FStretford, Trafford, have repeatedly
OL,15,Ffailed, with three dangerous incidents
OL,16,Freported in the space of a year.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,410,400,260,160,0,100
PN,40902
SC,0002
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F409A1790873772
OL,1,W5j 5Q7kj 5j js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSASlugs to blame for mystery of
OL,4,Afaulty traffic lights
OL,5,
OL,6,FEngineers were initially baffled, but
OL,7,FTransport for Greater Manchester has
OL,8,Fnow found the issues were caused by
OL,9,Fslugs "entering the signal controller,
OL,10,Fcausing short circuits", the Local
OL,11,FDemocracy Reporting Service said.
OL,13,F"This was the first time the highways
OL,14,Fteam had ever experienced this," said
OL,15,FCouncillor Steve Adshead.
